      "definition": "(G) As used in this section, \"full maintenance amount\" means the amount of total revenue that a school district likely would generate by one-half mill of the tax described in division (B) of section 3318.05 of the Revised Code over the entire twenty-three-year period required under that section, as determined by the commission in consultation with the department of taxation.",
